('p', 'As Table 2.1 shows, studies addressing each axis exist, but no study was found that integrates online continuous health estimation of per-sensor freshness and quality, evacuation-vs-stop distinction by risk grace and remaining perception/localization capability, evacuation speed limited to a stopping-distance-inverted cap, and validation on a real stack with verdict-secured encounter experiments. The position of this study is the integrated supervisory layer from detection through selection and speed, and its empirical demonstration.'),
